@startuml component-backend
!theme plain
title 后端子系统构件图（backend/internal）

[cli] as cli
[engine] as engine
[walk] as walk
[filter] as filter
[fsmeta] as fsmeta
[pack\nMyPack] as pack
[huffman] as huffman
[crypto/sha256] as sha
[crypto/hmac] as hmac
[crypto/pbkdf2] as pbkdf2
[crypto/aes] as aes
[container\n.dbk] as container
[repo] as repo
[config] as config
[jsonl] as jsonl
[version] as version
[testutil] as testutil <<test>>

cli ..> engine : Backup/DryRun/Restore
cli ..> repo : List/Info/Delete/Resolve
cli ..> config : Load/Save/Set
cli ..> jsonl : 事件输出
cli ..> version : --version
engine ..> walk : 先序遍历
engine ..> filter : Criteria→Decision
engine ..> pack : Writer/Reader
engine ..> huffman : 可选压缩
engine ..> container : .dbk 读写
engine ..> repo : 仓库落盘
walk ..> fsmeta : FileInfo/Lstat
walk ..> filter
pack ..> fsmeta
container ..> sha : 未加密校验
container ..> hmac : 加密校验
container ..> pbkdf2 : 口令→密钥
container ..> aes : CBC 加解密
filter ..> fsmeta
testutil ..> fsmeta

note bottom of cli : 依赖方向自上而下；pack/huffman/crypto/* 不依赖 engine/cli
@enduml
